{"id":"648579","name":"排骨板栗焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648579/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"板栗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨斩块用清水浸泡出血水。","img":"images/648579/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净的排骨沥干水份。","img":"images/648579/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，生抽，蚝油。","img":"images/648579/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"抓匀后再加入适量花生油，继续抓匀静置备用。","img":"images/648579/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮洗净切细备用。","img":"images/648579/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"玉米洗净剥粒备用。","img":"images/648579/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/648579/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"板栗洗净备用。","img":"images/648579/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入排骨煎香。","img":"images/648579/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入胡萝卜和玉米炒匀。","img":"images/648579/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入板栗翻炒。","img":"images/648579/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入适量盐。","img":"images/648579/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量蚝油。","img":"images/648579/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味后即可关火。","img":"images/648579/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"适量大米淘洗干净。","img":"images/648579/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"加入适量清水，水的量要比平时煮饭少一点。","img":"images/648579/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"盛入炒过的配菜。","img":"images/648579/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"电饭锅煮饭模式至程序结束。","img":"images/648579/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"米饭煮好后翻拌均匀，洒上葱花即可。","img":"images/648579/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648579/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648579/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648579/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648579/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}